      <h1 class="itbs-h1">Inverted Triangle Body Shape</h1>
      <p class="itbs-subtitle">Bust and shoulders noticeably broader than the hips, with a waist that's present but not sharply carved. Common among swimmers and naturally broad-shouldered frames. Here's the exact formula, a health-metric quirk worth knowing, and how to dress for it.</p>
